      <p source="#source-15137-15503">『ボズさん！』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15161-15176"><rb>僕</rb><rt>ぼく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15176-15179">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15179-15194"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15194-15200">はず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15200-15227"><rb>涙聲</rb><rt>なみだごゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15227-15230">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15230-15242"><rb>呼</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15242-15251">んだ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15251-15266"><rb>君</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15266-15269">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15269-15293"><rb>狂氣</rb><rt>きちがひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15293-15296">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15296-15314"><rb>眞似</rb><rt>まね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15314-15326">をすると</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15326-15338"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15338-15341">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15341-15356"><rb>玉</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15356-15365">ふか。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15365-15380"><rb>僕</rb><rt>ぼく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15380-15383">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15383-15398"><rb>實</rb><rt>じつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15398-15401">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15401-15425"><rb>滿眼</rb><rt>まんがん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15425-15428">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15428-15446"><rb>涙</rb><rt>なんだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15446-15449">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15449-15461"><rb>落</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15461-15470">つるに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15470-15482"><rb>任</rb